# Cloudflare Pages SPA fallback.
# Any path that isn't a real static file serves index.html, letting
# react-router handle /candy, /moshla, /lp/*, /admin etc. on hard refresh or
# a direct link.
#
# Pages Functions (functions/api/*) are matched before this rule, so /api/capi
# still reaches its Function. Even if it didn't, the client's CAPI beacon
# failing is a silent no-op — GA4 and the Meta Pixel are unaffected.
/*    /index.html   200
